WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:05.500
Your Majesty, Yao'er is your own flesh and blood! How could he possibly harbor thoughts of rebellion?!

00:06.000 --> 00:12.500
If you execute him today, you will be severing your own arm to please the aristocratic houses!

00:13.000 --> 00:18.500
Silence! Zhen knows what must be done. Summon the Prince of Jin to the elixir chamber!
